==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Miz Devil]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**5 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s (300%) spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As this is likely the most threatening Aku stage in Labyrinth, using your stronger anti-Aku options is recommended here.

==Trivia==
*The "boss" [[Miz Devil]] here is the only unbuffed Miz Devil in the game.

